' ==============================================================================
' @file 4-3-artconnect-portfolio-CD.puml
' @brief Structural class diagram of the artist portfolio, representative part.
'
' @details
' This artifact models the core responsibilities, entity relationships and access
' control rules for the representative portfolio operations: edditing one's own portfolio,
' adding artworks and displaying a public portfolio to other users. It enforces strict 
' ownership and visibility rules by defining the one-to-many relationship between a portfolio 
' and its artworks and specifying where access constraints are applied.
'
' Architectural Scope & Rationale:
' This model is explicitly scoped to the structural design of the portfolio domain. 
' It establishes clear architectural boundaries by categorizing components 
' into the Application Layer (views, serializers, and permissions that orchestrate
' workflows and enforce rules) and the Domain Layer (data-holding entities). 
' Persistence is delegated directly to the Django ORM rather than an abstracted repository interface.
' Only elements essential to these responsibilities are shown, as secondary views, serializers,
' artwork files, and exhibitions adhere to the same pattern, with full data persistence
' covered in the ER diagram (4.2).
'
' System Requirements Addressed:
' This model dictates the software implementation by defining:
' - The core profile and portfolio update workflows.
' - The visibility rules for adding artworks and managing their public or private status.
' - The structural filtering constraints required to display exclusively public artworks 
' on the public portfolio interface.
'
' Author(s): Klara Vlašić
' Context: Software Engineering Course
'
' AI Usage Disclosure:
' Designed by Klara Vlašić. AI-assisted revision and documentation comments were
' reviewed by the author, who is responsible for the final content.
'
' Traceability Note:
' The structural properties, methods, and relationships defined herein must 
' strictly map to the finalized object-oriented source code. Any deviations 
' introduced during development must be retroactively updated in this model 
' to maintain evidence chain completeness.
'
' Diagram level: Structural / Domain Design
' Diagram type:  Class Diagram
' ==============================================================================
@startuml
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 40
skinparam ranksep 40
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

' ==============================================================================
' Application Layer 
' Orchestrates use cases and delegates to the domain.
' ==============================================================================
package "Application Layer" {

  class IsArtist <<Permission>> {
    +has_permission(request, view): boolean
  }

  class MyPortfolioView <<View>> {
    +get_object(): ArtistProfile
    +get(): Response
    +patch(data): Response
  }

  class ArtworkListCreateView <<View>> {
    +get_queryset(): Artwork[0..*]
    +perform_create(serializer): void
  }

  class PublicArtistView <<View>> {
    +get_queryset(): ArtistProfile[0..*]
    +get(): Response
  }

  class MyPortfolioSerializer <<Serializer>> {
    +get_participations(profile): List
  }

  class PublicArtistSerializer <<Serializer>> {
    +get_art_fields(profile): ArtField[0..*]
    +get_artworks(profile): Artwork[0..*]
    +get_participations(profile): List
  }

}

' ==============================================================================
' Domain Layer 
' Encapsulates core business state, rules, and logic.
' ==============================================================================
package "Domain Layer" {

  class User <<Entity>> {
    +role: Role
    +is_active: boolean
  }

  class ArtistProfile <<Entity>> <<Portfolio>> {
    +portfolio_public: boolean
  }

  class Artwork <<Entity>> {
    +title: String
    +is_public: boolean
  }

  class ArtField <<Entity>> {
    +name: String
    +active: boolean
  }

  class ArtistField <<Association>>

}

' ==============================================================================
' Structural Relationships & Multiplicities
' ==============================================================================

' Domain: one portfolio has many artworks (deleting the owner deletes the artworks)
User "1" -- "0..1" ArtistProfile : is >
ArtistProfile "1" *-- "0..*" Artwork : portfolio contains >

' Many-to-many between artists and art fields through ArtistField
ArtistProfile "1" -- "0..*" ArtistField : works in >
ArtField "1" -- "0..*" ArtistField : groups >

' Application Layer: a view uses a serializer and is guarded by a permission
MyPortfolioView "1" --> "1" MyPortfolioSerializer : serializes with >
PublicArtistView "1" --> "1" PublicArtistSerializer : serializes with >
MyPortfolioView ..> IsArtist : requires >
ArtworkListCreateView ..> IsArtist : requires >

' Application Layer dependencies on the Domain
MyPortfolioView ..> ArtistProfile : edits own >
ArtworkListCreateView ..> Artwork : lists / creates own >
PublicArtistView ..> ArtistProfile : reads public >
PublicArtistView ..> User : filters is_active >
MyPortfolioSerializer ..> ArtistProfile
PublicArtistSerializer ..> ArtistProfile
PublicArtistSerializer "1" ..> "0..*" Artwork : shows public >
PublicArtistSerializer "1" ..> "0..*" ArtField : shows active >

' ==============================================================================
'  Constraints
' ==============================================================================

note left of ArtistProfile
  Portfolio:
  in the code the portfolio is represented by ArtistProfile.
  One portfolio has 0..* Artwork.
  portfolio_public makes the whole portfolio visible,
  is_public does the same for a single artwork.
end note

note right of PublicArtistView
  Visibility rules:
  - only logged-in users
  - profile visible only if
    portfolio_public = true AND user.is_active = true
  - artworks shown only if is_public = true
    (filtered in PublicArtistSerializer.get_artworks)
  - art fields shown only if active = true
    (filtered in PublicArtistSerializer.get_art_fields)
end note

note bottom of ArtworkListCreateView
  Ownership:
  - get_queryset returns only the logged-in artist's artworks
  - perform_create sets the artist from the login
end note

note left of MyPortfolioView
  PATCH only (no PUT).
  Works while portfolio_public = false;
  the artist publishes the portfolio here.
end note


@enduml